atch02/58-df-bounded-linear.md\">../batch02/58-df-bounded-linear.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,X^*,\\tau_{w^*}\\in V\">\\(X,X^*,\\tau_{w^*}\\in V\\)</span>；沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a> 中固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X\">\\(K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\)</span>，不在本谓词内重新选择它们。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},|\\cdot|_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},|\\cdot|_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> 为通常复数运算和绝对值的集合函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> 是下式定义的标准复平面拓扑。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFuncWeakStarTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFuncWeakStarTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S\\)</span> 使用依赖文件的十参数接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\{O\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in O\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|w-z|&lt;r\\to w\\in O)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\{O\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in O\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|w-z|&lt;r\\to w\\in O)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcFuncWeakStarTopology}_S(\\tau_{w^*},X,X^*)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land K_X=\\mathbb C\\\\\n&amp;\\land X^*=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(\\varphi,X,\\mathbb C,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},\\|\\cdot\\|_X,|\\cdot|_{\\mathbb C})\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{w^*},X^*)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;\\{\\varphi\\in X^*:\\varphi(x)\\in O\\}\\in\\tau_{w^*}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,X^*)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;\\{\\varphi\\in X^*:\\varphi(x)\\in O\\}\\in\\sigma\\ \\to\\ \\tau_{w^*}\\subseteq\\sigma\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcFuncWeakStarTopology}_S(\\tau_{w^*},X,X^*)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land K_X=\\mathbb C\\\\\n&amp;\\land X^*=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(\\varphi,X,\\mathbb C,\\mathbb C,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},\\|\\cdot\\|_X,|\\cdot|_{\\mathbb C})\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{w^*},X^*)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;\\{\\varphi\\in X^*:\\varphi(x)\\in O\\}\\in\\tau_{w^*}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,X^*)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;\\{\\varphi\\in X^*:\\varphi(x)\\in O\\}\\in\\sigma\\ \\to\\ \\tau_{w^*}\\subseteq\\sigma\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留复赋范空间上的弱星拓扑和三参数接口。求值映射的逆像直接写成集合，拓扑最小性不依赖本节文字。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"c740b73b26d2ecf9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-bounded-linear.md","status":"resolved","id":"261de7e0269cd7e2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-bounded-linear.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,X^*,\\tau_{w^*}\\in V$；沿用 [[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]] 中固定的 $K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X$，不在本谓词内重新选择它们。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-7","tar